OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuation as bomb unit checks
OL,4,A'suspicious' items
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 153 properties have been
OL,7,Fevacuated while a bomb disposal unit
OL,8,Finvestigates "suspicious substances and
OL,9,Fitems" at a property in
OL,10,FWeston-super-Mare.
OL,12,FThe Explosive Ordinance Disposal Unit
OL,13,Fwas called to Becket Road in Worle on
OL,14,FWednesday afternoon and a 100-metre
OL,15,F(328ft) cordon was set up in the area.
OL,17,FAvon and Somerset Police said they had
OL,18,Farrested a man in his 70s on suspicion
OL,19,Fof fraud by false representation at a
OL,20,Fproperty on Becket Road earlier, where
OL,21,Fthey found "suspicious substances and
OL,22,Fitems".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
