OL,4,A'suspicious' items
OL,5,
OL,6,FA refuge centre has been set up at
OL,7,FCastle Batch Children's Centre. Police
OL,8,Fsaid they were "working hard and at
OL,9,Fpace to try and resolve this issue as
OL,10,Fquickly and as safely as possible."
